{"n":114,"b":true,"a":[["قُلْ اَعُوْذُ بِرَبِّ النَّاسِۙ","Qul a'uzu birabbin naas","Katakanlah, “Aku berlindung kepada Tuhannya manusia,",30,604,0],["مَلِكِ النَّاسِۙ","Malikin naas","Raja manusia,",30,604,0],["اِلٰهِ النَّاسِۙ","Ilaahin naas","sembahan manusia,",30,604,0],["مِنْ شَرِّ الْوَسْوَاسِ ەۙ الْخَنَّاسِۖ","Min sharril was waasil khannaas","dari kejahatan (bisikan) setan yang bersembunyi,",30,604,0],["الَّذِيْ يُوَسْوِسُ فِيْ صُدُوْرِ النَّاسِۙ","Al lazee yuwas wisu fee sudoorin naas","yang membisikkan (kejahatan) ke dalam dada manusia,",30,604,0],["مِنَ الْجِنَّةِ وَالنَّاسِ ࣖ","Minal jinnati wan naas","dari (golongan) jin dan manusia.”",30,604,0]]}